  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the current Live graph we can do this by switching to (T), attach the output to the input, then switch to (Type) again.\nBut in beta, we can't attach this to anything that requires UdonBehaviour as input.\nThis could potentially break graphs that use the live method to do things with the  remote Behaviour in something like OnTriggerEnter",
